    {
      "name": "datalog_query",
      "description": "Execute a raw CozoScript (Datalog) query against the project fact graph.\n\nProvides expert-level access to the underlying CozoDB relations for\ncomposable, recursive, and cross-relation queries beyond what\nquery_facts supports.\n\nAvailable stored relations (prefix with * to query):\n  symbol       {qualified_name => file_path, name, kind, line, end_line, parent}\n  call         {caller_qn, callee_qn, file_path, line, col}\n  reference    {symbol_qn, file_path, line, col => ref_kind}\n  taint_flow   {source_var, sink_var, label, file_path, func_qn, source_line, sink_line}\n  type_binding {symbol_qn, file_path, line, binding_kind => type_str}\n  import       {importing_file, imported_module, imported_name, line => alias}\n  cfg_edge     {file_path, func_qn, from_block, to_block, edge_kind, from_line, to_line}\n  def_use      {file_path, func_qn, var_name, def_line, def_col, use_line, use_col}\n\nExample queries:\n\nAll function symbols:\n  ?[name, file] := *symbol[qn, file, name, \"function\", l, e, p]\n\nDead code (symbols with no references):\n  has_ref[qn] := *reference[qn, _, _, _, _]\n  dead[name, file, line] := *symbol[qn, file, name, kind, line, _, _], not has_ref[qn]\n  ?[name, file, line] := dead[name, file, line]\n\nTransitive callers of a function:\n  reaches[a] := *call[a, \"mymod.func\", _, _, _]\n  reaches[a] := *call[a, mid, _, _, _], reaches[mid]\n  ?[a] := reaches[a]\n",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "description": "CozoScript (Datalog) query to execute against the project fact graph.",
            "title": "Query",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "project": {
            "default": ".",
            "description": "Project root directory.",
            "title": "Project",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "limit": {
            "default": 200,
            "description": "Maximum number of result rows to return. 0 means unlimited.",
            "title": "Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "query"
        ],
        "title": "datalog_queryArguments",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
